```bash
kubectl describe pvc mysql-pvc
```

---

## Check StorageClass

```bash
kubectl get storageclass
```

---

# 29. Common Storage Problems

## PVC stuck in Pending

Possible causes:

* No StorageClass
* Wrong access mode
* CSI driver missing

---

## Pod cannot mount volume

Check:

```bash
kubectl describe pod pod-name
```

---

## EBS attachment failure

Check:

* Availability Zone
* Node capacity
* IAM permissions

